    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Control a camera that's been lowered deep into a hole.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to reach the bottom and reveal what lurks in the depths. But beware\u2014you must evade every threat, natural or unnatural, that could destroy your camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400420/extras/238d886429a795f859095f2e30011702.avif?t=1749367758\" width=600 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game can be completed using only your mouse. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Move to look around, left-click to descend, and right-click ascend. You can also pause the game by pressing ESC if you want to.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid unnatural threats. Move at the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A short horror game where you explore a deep hole.</i> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Control a camera that's been lowered deep into a hole.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to reach the bottom and reveal what lurks in the depths. But beware\u2014you must evade every threat, natural or unnatural, that could destroy your camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400420/extras/238d886429a795f859095f2e30011702.avif?t=1749367758\" width=600 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game can be completed using only your mouse. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Move to look around, left-click to descend, and right-click ascend. You can also pause the game by pressing ESC if you want to.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid unnatural threats. Move at the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A short horror game where you explore a deep hole.</i> </p>",
